\right]\] Synchronous speed: \[N_{s}
=
\frac{120f}{P}
=
\frac{120\times 50}{4}
=
1500\,\text{rpm}\] \[\omega_{s}
=
\frac{2\pi N_{s}}{60}
=
\frac{2\pi\times1500}{60}
=
50\pi\,\text{rad/s}\] Phase voltage: \[V_{ph}
=
